xku@vax5.cit.cornell.edu writes
> Hello, I am also a beginning player of Hack 3.0j. I'd just like to know a few
> basic things:
> 
> 1) How do you get new pets?
> 2) How do you ID the alignment of a fountain?
> 3) How do I get a copy of the spoiler file ;)
> 
> 
> E-mail or whatever
> 
> Davin

1) Anytime you run into a kitten/housecat/large cat or little dog/dog/large  
dog, even if it's attacking you, throw a tripe ration, an recently-killed  
corpse, or a food ration at it.  (Other food items might work as well.)  If the  
dog/cat eats it, then you have a new pet.  You can do this even if you still  
have one or more pets.  Charm monster spells can get you more exotic pets.  If  
you become a wererat/wolf/whatever, you can summon your brethen and get  
rats/wolves/whatever as pets.  Also, if you polymorph into an egg-laying  
creature(it will tell you that you can lay eggs by sitting)you can lay eggs  
which will hatch into offspring pets.
2) Fountains don't have alignments.  Only altars have alignments, and you can  
find theirs out by using ':' when you're atop them.
3) Watch for the FAQ posting that comes periodically.  If someone hasn't sent  
you one already.
